List of compliance requirements
===============================

Descriptions of section entries and preferred order
---------------------------------------------------

	M: *Mail* The email addresses of the entity that is the subject of the
	    requirement, accepting regex:
	    FullName <address@domain> or <*@domain>
	S: *Status*, one of the following:
	   No Participation:	Any participation in the project is prohibited.
	   No Maintainer:	Act as a maintainer for the project is prohibited.
	   Warning:		Participation in the project is allowed,
	   			but warnings are issued to other participants.
	R: *Reason* The reason for the requirement.

